stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> setup
  setup --> ready: valid maze and route
  ready --> setup: read_maze
  ready --> playing: start
  playing --> paused: pause, hand in playfield,<br/>data lost
  paused --> paused: read_maze
  paused --> playing: resume (valid route, fresh data)
  playing --> finished: ball on exit, time limit, stop
  paused --> finished: stop
  finished --> ready: new_game
  e_stop --> setup: clear_e_stop
  note right of e_stop
    Entered from any state on the
    E-stop button or command.
    A running game ends as aborted.
  end note
